      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>the vagabonds (\u1e63a\u02bf\u0101l\u012bk): 100 counterfeit d\u012bn\u0101rs [ ... ] the q\u0101\u1e0d\u012b [ &hellip; ] 150 of them, 113\u2154 on my own behalf, some of them for al-K\u014dh\u0113n, 16\u2154&nbsp;</li>\n<li>for my paternal uncle similarly. In my opinion, this is correct for everyone. If my uncle prefers, he may take the ring I told him about &mdash;</li>\n<li>it is here with me, a share belonging to him. I will proceed step by step, and finally settle the accounts, if [ ... ] the week remains such that [ ... ]</li>\n<li>I have informed my lord of this. I have settled with them for 7 d\u012bn\u0101rs on [ ... ] and one-third; the price is 15 d\u012bn(\u0101rs) per load.</li>\n<li>I will say that [ ... ] from them &mdash; what remains with them from me from the start [ ... ] the week [ ... ] I will collect</li>\n<li>[ ... ] at the beginning of Rama\u1e0d\u0101n. If my paternal uncle does not prefer to take it, let my lord [ ... ] divide it between me and al-K\u014dh\u0113n.</li>\n<li>I have informed my lord of this [ ... ], and I need not press my lord regarding delivery of the d\u012bn(\u0101rs) he owes.</li>\n<li>[ ... ] my lord, the purse of d\u012bn(\u0101rs) &mdash; perhaps</li>\n<li>something will work out for me [ ... ].&nbsp;I have already paid for flax: 296 (?), 23 [ ... ] 24.</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
